WEBVTT

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.351
that my mom and I have always
had a close relationship,

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:33.476
I never told her.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.018
Even with recent movements
bringing the topics

00:00:36.042 --> 00:00:40.101
of sexual abuse and sexual assault
into mainstream conversation,

00:00:40.125 --> 00:00:41.792
I stayed silent.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:47.625
And I guarantee that for every
brave soul who said "Me too,"

00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:51.417
there were countless others who didn't ...

00:00:52.542 --> 00:00:54.042
who still haven't.

00:00:55.958 --> 00:00:58.167
Why didn't those people speak up earlier?

00:00:59.083 --> 00:01:00.458
Why didn't I?